    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Heaven Can Wait is a luxury 5BR/5.5BA home in WaterColor’s Camp District on a quiet street across from a small park. Enjoy a private heated saltwater pool and spa, a spacious screened porch, and fast access to Camp WaterColor (lazy river + slides). Under 1 mile to the Beach Club, private beach access, and Seaside on 30A.<br><br>***Why you’ll love it***<br>Professionally designed; all bedrooms have private baths; sleeps 12 (8 adults max + bunk room)<br>Chef’s kitchen: Sub‑Zero fridge, Wolf gas range, wine cooler; service for 12<br>Bright great room with Smart TV, streaming sound, dining and game tables, gas fireplace<br>Owner‑managed for attentive service<br><br>***Sleep setup***<br>Main‑level King suite<br>Upstairs King primary: soaking tub, shower, porch access<br>Upstairs King suite with bathtub<br>Upstairs suite with 2 Queens + porch<br>Bunk room with 4 XL twins (curtained entry) + full bath<br><br>***Outdoor living***<br>Private heated saltwater pool & spa backing to preserve<br>Large screened dining porch, Weber grill, loungers, umbrella, outdoor shower, sound system<br>Front porch overlooking the park<br><br>***Resort access (fee)***<br>WaterColor wristbands required for amenities (ages 5+); $1,025/week per group via HOA registration. This fee is included in your quote. <br><br>Includes Beach Club (private beach access), Camp WaterColor, 9 pools, Boathouse on Western Lake, tennis & pickleball<br><br>***Getting around***<br>6 beach cruisers included<br>Optional 6‑passenger GEM LSV rental (roads ≤30 mph)<br>Minutes to Seaside, Beach Club, Boathouse, WaterColor Crossings (Publix)<br><br>***Parking***<br>1 vehicle pass; driveway fits 2 cars + golf cart; overflow on community pads<br><br>***Policies***<br>Max occupancy 12; families and responsible adults 30+ only<br>Resort passes issued only to registered guests<br>Payment: 50% at booking; balance due 60 days before arrival; no refunds within 60 days; $250 cancellation fee on all cancellations<br><br>Your WaterColor retreat with a private pool, spa, and easy resort access awaits—send your dates to book.",
